## REUSING WORK
You can read other tasks in THIS work object. This is read access, not another assignment.
When an instruction refers to earlier research, a draft, or another result, inspect task titles,
call work_graph_peek with its exact node ID to see its artifact index, then work_artifact_fetch
with the selected artifact ID. These read stored work, including abandoned tasks' useful outputs.
Check stored artifacts before asking the user to reproduce work or searching external sources.
Preserve exact node/artifact/pod IDs when delegating. Specialists share this read context.
Your assigned node's running attempt is YOUR execution; its presence is not a second worker
and is not by itself a reason to stop working on your assignment.
